tip up","kind":"p2"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv2.mp3","label":"吃 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v3","en":"Korea","note":"2+2: both rise. No sandhi.","cells":[{"ch":"韓","py":"hán","t":2,"s":"韩","mk":["h","~","#E67700"]},{"ch":"國","py":"guó","t":2,"s":"国"}],"cues":[{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv3.mp3","label":"韓國 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v4","en":"vegetables / cuisine","note":"4th. c is aspirated (a puff), the pair of unaspirated z.","cells":[{"ch":"菜","py":"cài","t":4,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"c","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv4.mp3","label":"菜 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v5","en":"ramen","note":"1+4. 麵 ends in -n.","cells":[{"ch":"拉","py":"lā","t":1},{"ch":"麵","py":"miàn","t":4,"s":"面","fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"]]}],"cues":[{"chip":"-n","lab":"miàn","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv5.mp3","label":"拉麵 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v6","en":"dinner (\"evening meal\")","note":"3+1: 晚 stays a low half-third before the high 餐.","cells":[{"ch":"晚","py":"wǎn","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"]},{"ch":"餐","py":"cān","t":1}],"cues":[{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"wǎn","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv6.mp3","label":"晚餐 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v7","en":"do you want...?","note":"Say yào bú yào. 不 rises before the 4th 要. A-not-A question, beside 嗎.","cells":[{"ch":"要","py":"yào","t":4},{"ch":"不","py":"bù","t":4,"said":"bú","mk":["bu","↗","#17A398"]},{"ch":"要","py":"yào","t":4}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"bù yào","cue":"bù → bú before a 4th","kind":"bu"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv7.mp3","label":"要不要 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v8","en":"together","note":"Show notes print yīqǐ. Say yì qǐ: 一 falls before the 3rd 起.","cells":[{"ch":"一","py":"yī","t":1,"said":"yì","mk":["yi","↗","#17A398"]},{"ch":"起","py":"qǐ","t":3}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"yī qǐ","cue":"yī → yì before a 3rd","kind":"yi"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv8.mp3","label":"一起 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v9","en":"restaurant","note":"1+1 plateau. t is aspirated; -ng is the back nasal.","cells":[{"ch":"餐","py":"cān","t":1},{"ch":"廳","py":"tīng","t":1,"s":"厅","mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"],"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"]]}],"cues":[{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"},{"chip":"-ng","lab":"tīng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv9.mp3","label":"餐廳 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v10","en":"a long time","note":"3rd alone. In 很久, 很 rises: hén jiǔ.","cells":[{"ch":"久","py":"jiǔ","t":3}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv10.mp3","label":"久 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v11","en":"car","note":"1st. ch retroflex.","cells":[{"ch":"車","py":"chē","t":1,"s":"车","mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"ch","cue":"Position 2: tip up","kind":"p2"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv11.mp3","label":"車 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v12","en":"to open","note":"1st. k is aspirated. With 車 it means to drive.","cells":[{"ch":"開","py":"kāi","t":1,"s":"开","mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"k","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv12.mp3","label":"開 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v13","en":"to drive a car","note":"1+1. 開 'open' + 車 'car'.","cells":[{"ch":"開","py":"kāi","t":1,"s":"开"},{"ch":"車","py":"chē","t":1,"s":"车"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv13.mp3","label":"開車 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v14","en":"time","note":"Show notes: shíhòu (2+4). Speech often lightens 候 (shíhou). Cells keep the printed 4th; the pitch was not measured.","cells":[{"ch":"時","py":"shí","t":2,"s":"时","mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"候","py":"hòu","t":4}],"cues":[{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"sh","cue":"Position 2: tip up","kind":"p2"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv14.mp3","label":"時候 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v15","en":"when","note":"什麼 is a rise plus light 麼, then 時候. Same 候 caution as the word 時候.","cells":[{"ch":"什","py":"shén","t":2},{"ch":"麼","py":"me","t":5,"s":"么"},{"ch":"時","py":"shí","t":2,"s":"时"},{"ch":"候","py":"hòu","t":4}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv15.mp3","label":"什麼時候 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v16","en":"he / she","note":"1st. Third person singular. Plural 他們: 們 is neutral (tāmen).","cells":[{"ch":"他","py":"tā","t":1}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv16.mp3","label":"他 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v17","en":"hungry","note":"4th, full fall.","cells":[{"ch":"餓","py":"è","t":4,"s":"饿"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv17.mp3","label":"餓 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v18","en":"right then / about to","note":"4th. Show notes give no single gloss ('keep an eye on this word'). Here 就要 is about to, right then. The host says 就 often marks something earlier or more than expected, and that it returns in later lessons.","cells":[{"ch":"就","py":"jiù","t":4,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"j","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/Vv18.mp3","label":"就 · synthetic","real":false,"voice":"female"}]}]},{"type":"cards","title":"Listening notes","items":[["小李 is a 3+3: xiáo Lǐ.","小 and 李 are both 3rd tone, so 小 rises: xiáo Lǐ, not a low xiǎo. Same pair rule as 可以 and 你想 in lesson 07."],["一 changes before 起 and before 下.","一起 is yì qǐ: 一 falls (a 4th) before the 3rd 起. 等一下 is děng yí xià: 一 rises (a 2nd) before the 4th 下. The show notes print citation yī."],["不 rises in 要不要.","要不要 is yào bú yào. 不 becomes bú before a 4th. It is the A-not-A question (do you want to or not?), beside 嗎 questions such as 你開車嗎."],["3+3 in 很久 and 我也, and the half-third.","很久 is hén jiǔ: 很 rises. 我也 before 喜歡 is marked wó yě, the same pair as 我也累: 我 rises and 也 stays a 3rd. 喜 is also a 3rd before neutral 歡, so a tighter phrasing raises 也 too (wó yé xǐ); this take was not measured, so only the 我也 pair is marked. A 3rd before a non-3rd (你最, 我要, 晚餐's 晚, 等一下's 等) stays low and does not rise: the blue ↓ half-third."],["Neutral syllables stay short.","Light and unstressed: 麼 in 什麼, 歡 in 喜歡, 了, 們 in 他們 / 我們, 呢, 啊, 嗎, 吧. They do not carry a full 1–4 tone. 啊 after 對 (-ui) picks up the ya coloring from lesson 07; after 好 (-ao) it is often wa. The characters follow the show notes (啊)."],["什麼時候, and 就.","什麼 is a rise plus a light 麼. 時候 is printed shíhòu in the show notes; speech often lightens 候 to shíhou, and these cells keep the printed 4th because the pitch was not measured. 就 is the word the episode tells you to watch: here 就要 means about to, right then."],["那好.","The show notes write 那好 (nà hǎo), all right then. A second transcription sometimes hears 哪好. 那 and 哪 are close on this take; the line follows the show notes."]]}],"schema":1,"date":"2026-11-17T09:00-05:00"}
